    <briefdescription>
<para>Event data loaded into a session. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1SessionData" kindref="compound">SessionData</ref> organizes podio event frames into named categories.</para>
<para>A category contains an ordered sequence of <computeroutput>podio::Frame</computeroutput> objects. The category name is used to distinguish different data sources or logical groups of events within a session.</para>
